{y}^{2} \\\\ 12 & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{2}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola with semi-axes of lengths $\\sqrt{3}$ and $2.$" 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418047 1062 #uuid "af8eee1b-35b6-51ee-8480-e799f2ebb8d2" 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418047 1063 #edb/ref 17592186284465 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418048 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418047 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418048 1062 #uuid "b0e9f4df-c7d1-5c3e-9d66-792c898f4bac" 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418048 1063 #edb/ref 17592186339088 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418049 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418051 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418049 1062 #uuid "bbc73c40-2938-59e4-adf6-e2670e949f1e" 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418049 1063 #edb/ref 17592186418046 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418050 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418048 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418050 1062 #uuid "c8e375d5-a259-54e0-ae9f-f99977167c51" 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418050 1063 #edb/ref 17592186366233 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418051 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418050 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418051 1062 #uuid "f747c054-c600-575d-8af5-3ac0554fc78c" 13194139534297 17592186045417 true] [17592186418051 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323729 13194139534297 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-58642185-16fa-5318-8c89-f9d4ccf0c829" 17592186418039 "answer-019726e7-4913-502a-a919-de71561128cf" 17592186418040 "answer-31103cb3-8db8-5966-8f8f-150d81076c20" 17592186418041 "answer-3a2b823c-f5c0-585b-b3ff-0eec4bcfc2e2" 17592186418042 "answer-9e786335-093c-5020-9d1b-5216151e0ab3" 17592186418043 "answer-ce083963-6a81-5daf-90c1-ac994c70d5be" 17592186418044 "answer-field-8a4ae1c8-63c4-5962-bc3f-7d5f1634e01e" 17592186418045 "ques